{title: Deewana Hua Badal}
{artist: Mohammed Rafi O P Nayyar}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G]Diwana hua badal,        sa [D]wan kee ghata chhayee
ye [D]dekh ke [A]dil zoo [C]ma,        liyee [G]pyar ne angada [C]yee
[G]Diwana hua badal,        [G]Aisee to meree takadeer na thi
tum [C]sa jo koee meha [G]boob mile,        dil [C]aaj khushee se [D]pagal [C]hai
dil [C]aaj khushee se [D]pagal [C]hai,        aye [D]jan-e-wafa tum [G]khub mile
aye [C]jan-e- [G]wafa tum [C]khub mile,        dil [G]kyoo na bane pagal
kya [D]tumane ada payee,        ye [D]dekh ke [A]dil zoo [C]ma,
liyee [G]pyar ne angada [C]yee,        [G]Diwana hua badal
[G]Jab tum se najar takarayee sanam,        jaj [C]bat ka yek tu [G]fan uthha
tina [F]ke kee tarah main [G]bah nikli,        sai [G]lab me [C]re ro [G]ke na ruka
sai [C]lab [G]mere ro [C]ke na ruka,        jee [G]wan mein machee halachal
aur [D]bajane lagee shahanaee,        ye [D]dekh ke [A]dil zoo [C]ma,
liyee [G]pyar ne angada [C]yee,        [G]Diwana hua badal
[G]Hai aj naye aramanon se,        a [C]bad mere dil [G]kee nagaree
bara [C]son se khija ka [D]alam [C]tha,        bara [C]son se khija ka [D]alam [C]tha
wi [D]ran badee duni [G]yan thee meree,        wi [C]ran ba [G]dee duni [C]yan thee meree
ha [G]thon mein tera anchal,        a [D]ya ke bahar ayee
ye [D]dekh ke [A]dil zoo [C]ma,        liyee [G]pyar ne angada [C]yee
[G]Diwana hua badal
